13
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:56,560
To be continued...

14
00:01:57,000 --> 00:02:12,720
Thinril Rulercase, member of the Black Bull's Magic Knight Squad, had some concerns, some

15
00:02:12,720 --> 00:02:14,680
very serious concerns.

16
00:02:14,680 --> 00:02:16,400
What now?

17
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:18,580
What should I do?

18
00:02:18,580 --> 00:02:21,120
Was it a mission that had him so preoccupied?

19
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:23,580
The Mixer tonight!

20
00:02:23,580 --> 00:02:29,800
No, he was planning a Mixer, a party meant to help men and women forge closer friendships.

21
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:32,200
Let's see, how do I want to arrange this?

22
00:02:32,200 --> 00:02:34,460
I have three ladies lined up already.

23
00:02:34,460 --> 00:02:37,200
Mmm, a line of ladies.

24
00:02:37,200 --> 00:02:38,200
No!

25
00:02:38,200 --> 00:02:39,200
Focus, Spinral!

26
00:02:39,200 --> 00:02:42,360
You have to decide which squad mates to bring with you.

27
00:02:42,360 --> 00:02:44,700
Asta's a firecracker, so he's a must.

28
00:02:44,700 --> 00:02:47,200
But I need one more.

29
00:02:53,580 --> 00:03:02,300
Flame magic!

30
00:03:02,300 --> 00:03:08,580
My exploding fireball!

31
00:03:08,580 --> 00:03:20,300
Home run, baby!

32
00:03:20,300 --> 00:03:21,300
Oh yeah!

33
00:03:21,300 --> 00:03:22,300
Nice one!

34
00:03:22,300 --> 00:03:23,300
Maybe.

35
00:03:23,300 --> 00:03:26,300
Girls do like the whole bad boy thing.

36
00:03:26,300 --> 00:03:29,300
Hey ladies!

37
00:03:29,300 --> 00:03:31,300
You want to see a real man's ride?

38
00:03:31,300 --> 00:03:33,560
Check out my crazy cyclone here.

39
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:37,300
Just hop on and I'll treat you to the film magnet experience.

40
00:03:37,300 --> 00:03:51,800
But Magna's more of an acquired taste, huh?

41
00:03:51,800 --> 00:03:52,800
Almost there.

42
00:03:52,800 --> 00:03:56,920
Soon I'll have a life-size statue of my Marie in all her glory.

43
00:03:56,920 --> 00:03:58,520
Oh, Marie.

44
00:03:58,520 --> 00:04:00,620
I can feel you here beside me.

45
00:04:00,620 --> 00:04:02,620
My beloved little sister.

46
00:04:02,620 --> 00:04:03,620
No.

47
00:04:03,620 --> 00:04:05,620
I can just see it now.

48
00:04:05,620 --> 00:04:11,320
Take a look at my Marie.

49
00:04:11,320 --> 00:04:13,620
Have you ever seen anybody more angelic?

50
00:04:13,620 --> 00:04:14,620
No.

51
00:04:14,620 --> 00:04:17,120
Because there is no one who can compare to her.

52
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:18,120
Ew.

53
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:19,120
So gross.

54
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:30,120
That's one way to kill the mood.

55
00:04:30,120 --> 00:04:33,360
Nobody knows what Gordon is thinking ever.

56
00:04:33,360 --> 00:04:53,360
I don't know.

57
00:04:53,360 --> 00:04:57,360
Charmy might liven things up a bit if I brought her like a little mascot.

58
00:04:57,360 --> 00:05:04,360
Although…

59
00:05:04,360 --> 00:05:06,360
Excuse me!

60
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:08,360
Can I get some more?

61
00:05:08,360 --> 00:05:09,360
Very sorry.

62
00:05:09,360 --> 00:05:14,360
We only opened five minutes ago, but we're already out of food.

63
00:05:14,360 --> 00:05:16,360
That would be a disaster.

64
00:05:16,360 --> 00:05:17,360
Okay.

65
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:18,360
No Charmy then.

66
00:05:18,360 --> 00:05:20,360
So, what about Vanessa?

67
00:05:20,360 --> 00:05:27,360
Assuming she's sober.

68
00:05:27,360 --> 00:05:28,360
That's a no-go.

69
00:05:32,360 --> 00:05:33,360
Yeah.

70
00:05:33,360 --> 00:05:35,360
That's what I'm talking about.

71
00:05:38,360 --> 00:05:40,360
I could see if Captain Yami wants to go.

72
00:05:40,360 --> 00:05:43,360
Some ladies have a thing for older men, right?

73
00:05:43,360 --> 00:05:46,360
Except, he is a little rough around the edges.

74
00:05:46,360 --> 00:05:52,360
What's up with those goofy little outfits anyway, huh?

75
00:05:52,360 --> 00:05:54,360
Not wearing any hats or gloves either.

76
00:05:54,360 --> 00:05:56,360
You ought to cover up more.

77
00:05:56,360 --> 00:05:58,360
Jeez, you want to catch a cold or something?

78
00:05:58,360 --> 00:05:59,360
Well?

79
00:05:59,360 --> 00:06:00,360
Uh…

80
00:06:00,360 --> 00:06:01,360
What?

81
00:06:01,360 --> 00:06:03,360
Seriously?

82
00:06:03,360 --> 00:06:04,360
Hard pass.

83
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:09,360
That just leaves me with one option.

84
00:06:12,360 --> 00:06:13,360
A mixer?

85
00:06:13,360 --> 00:06:14,360
Okay.

86
00:06:14,360 --> 00:06:15,360
Excellent.

87
00:06:15,360 --> 00:06:16,360
I'm glad you're on board.

88
00:06:16,360 --> 00:06:17,360
Yeah.

89
00:06:17,360 --> 00:06:19,360
Luck at least looks sane.

90
00:06:19,360 --> 00:06:20,360
He should do fine.

91
00:06:20,360 --> 00:06:21,360
Hey.

92
00:06:21,360 --> 00:06:22,360
What is a mixer?

93
00:06:22,360 --> 00:06:24,360
This'll be great.

94
00:06:28,360 --> 00:06:29,360
All right.

95
00:06:29,360 --> 00:06:30,360
We're all set.

96
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:32,360
So wearing our robes is okay?

97
00:06:32,360 --> 00:06:35,360
We want to make it crystal clear that we're magic knights.

98
00:06:35,360 --> 00:06:36,360
The people look up to us.

99
00:06:36,360 --> 00:06:39,360
I see no reason not to use that to our advantage.

100
00:06:39,360 --> 00:06:40,360
Sure.

101
00:06:40,360 --> 00:06:41,360
I got it.

102
00:06:41,360 --> 00:06:43,360
So what are mixers like anyway?

103
00:06:43,360 --> 00:06:44,360
Think we'll get to fight?

104
00:06:44,360 --> 00:06:45,360
I don't know.

105
00:06:45,360 --> 00:06:47,360
I've never been to one before.

106
00:06:47,360 --> 00:06:48,360
Yeah.

107
00:06:48,360 --> 00:06:49,360
Just great.

108
00:06:49,360 --> 00:06:50,360
Okay.

109
00:06:50,360 --> 00:06:51,360
Let's go.

110
00:06:51,360 --> 00:06:52,360
Well?

111
00:06:52,360 --> 00:06:53,360
You coming?

112
00:06:53,360 --> 00:06:54,360
Yes, sir!

113
00:06:54,360 --> 00:06:55,360
Here.

114
00:06:55,360 --> 00:06:56,360
Here.

115
00:06:56,360 --> 00:06:59,080
Health

116
00:06:59,080 --> 00:07:00,360
work.

117
00:07:00,360 --> 00:07:01,360
DR.

118
00:07:01,360 --> 00:07:03,360
Out we go.

119
00:07:07,360 --> 00:07:12,360
Sir.

120
00:07:12,360 --> 00:07:13,360
Good.

121
00:07:13,360 --> 00:07:14,360
Made it.

122
00:07:14,360 --> 00:07:18,100
Good. Made it.

123
00:07:23,380 --> 00:07:26,640
What was I thinking? Skulking after them to some silly mixer.

124
00:07:27,040 --> 00:07:31,420
I got all worried because that cretin wants to indulge himself in a little lowbrow socializing.

125
00:07:33,140 --> 00:07:35,180
No, I am not thinking about him!

126
00:07:35,180 --> 00:07:39,100
He's a useless musclehead and I couldn't care less what he wants to do with his free time!

127
00:07:39,560 --> 00:07:42,380
Who am I making excuses to anyway?

128
00:07:44,360 --> 00:07:51,360
Right. Let's see. Where... Ah! There we go!

129
00:08:06,960 --> 00:08:11,600
Well, looks like everybody's got drinks now. I'd say introductions are in order.

130
00:08:12,240 --> 00:08:14,000
I'll start then, shall I?

131
00:08:15,360 --> 00:08:23,360
I'm Finral Rulacase, 21-year-old spatial magic user from Toda and a Black Bulls squad member. Hi there.

132
00:08:23,360 --> 00:08:30,360
Have a freshly picked moon blossom as a symbol of our acquaintance.

133
00:08:30,360 --> 00:08:32,360
Wow! How nice!

134
00:08:32,360 --> 00:08:36,360
These are hard to get. They only bloom at night on Mount Anahu. They smell so good!

135
00:08:36,360 --> 00:08:37,360
Thank you.

136
00:08:37,360 --> 00:08:45,360
All right, I've got them interested. I'll land a girlfriend this time for sure. I just need Asta and Luck to pull their weight.

137
00:08:45,360 --> 00:08:46,360
Now, who would like to introduce themselves?

138
00:08:46,360 --> 00:08:54,360
I guess I'll go. This shouldn't be too hard, right? Okay.

139
00:08:54,360 --> 00:09:03,360
I'm Luck Boltia, 18 years old from Ebon. I'm a member of the Black Bulls too! My favorite thing is life or death battles against super strong opponents, the bloodier the better!

140
00:09:03,360 --> 00:09:05,360
And my motto is do or die!

141
00:09:12,360 --> 00:09:17,360
It's my turn. A real man would probably talk about his dreams and stuff, huh? All right!

142
00:09:17,360 --> 00:09:29,360
Hi! I'm Asta! I'm 15 from Hajj Village and I'm a Black Bull! And, um, my dream is to be the Wizard King!

143
00:09:29,360 --> 00:09:31,360
Uh, the Wizard King?

144
00:09:31,360 --> 00:09:33,360
No way. He's just a kid.

145
00:09:33,360 --> 00:09:37,360
I don't know about these two. They look like trouble.

146
00:09:37,360 --> 00:09:43,360
It's great that they're magic knights and all, but did they have to be Black Bulls? Lowest of the low.

147
00:09:43,360 --> 00:09:47,360
Isn't Hajj a commoner village in the middle of nowhere?

148
00:09:47,360 --> 00:09:52,360
If he isn't taller, wealthier, and of a higher social standing than I am, what's the point?

149
00:09:52,360 --> 00:09:53,360
Just forget it.

150
00:09:54,360 --> 00:09:57,360
Uh-oh. I'm not getting an interested vibe.

151
00:09:59,360 --> 00:10:08,360
Okay! Well, that does it for us. Now, let's hear all about you. We're dying to learn more, ladies. You ready? Let's go!

152
00:10:08,360 --> 00:10:13,360
Well, I don't know what to say, really. We're all friends. I'm Erica, and I work for a dressmaker.

153
00:10:13,360 --> 00:10:16,360
I'm Helena, and I work at a barber shop.

154
00:10:16,360 --> 00:10:18,360
Rebecca, I work at a restaurant.

155
00:10:18,360 --> 00:10:20,360
Nope. Not interested at all.

156
00:10:21,360 --> 00:10:24,360
Wow! You all work! That's great!

157
00:10:24,360 --> 00:10:30,360
I'd love to hear a little bit more about what you do. Maybe you could make me an outfit. What do you think would look good on me?

158
00:10:30,360 --> 00:10:34,360
Would you give me a haircut? I think it's time for me to try out a new look.

159
00:10:34,360 --> 00:10:41,360
Can I drop in for a bite? Well, that didn't work. What's a topic that might reel them in?

160
00:10:42,360 --> 00:10:45,360
So, want to hear about what we do as Magic Knights?

161
00:10:45,360 --> 00:10:48,360
Yes! That would be wonderful! Please tell us everything!

162
00:10:48,360 --> 00:10:57,360
Bingo! I'm happy to oblige. I get to see a lot of different places as a spatial magic user. I could tell you about some of my recent travels.

163
00:10:57,360 --> 00:10:58,360
Please do.

164
00:10:58,360 --> 00:11:00,360
Uh, well...

165
00:11:00,360 --> 00:11:03,360
Hey, I need to get to the jawn quick.

166
00:11:03,360 --> 00:11:04,360
Right!

167
00:11:06,360 --> 00:11:08,360
Fenroll, it's bath time.

168
00:11:08,360 --> 00:11:09,360
Right!

169
00:11:09,360 --> 00:11:11,360
So, uh, I'm ready for bed.

170
00:11:11,360 --> 00:11:12,360
Right.

171
00:11:12,360 --> 00:11:15,360
Lately, all I've been doing is dealing with Yami.

172
00:11:15,360 --> 00:11:19,360
Look! You've been working hard! Tell us about it!

173
00:11:19,360 --> 00:11:20,360
Oh, me?

174
00:11:20,360 --> 00:11:25,360
Well, go on now. Don't be shy. The ladies did say they wanted to hear everything.

175
00:11:25,360 --> 00:11:27,360
My work, huh? Let me think.

176
00:11:27,360 --> 00:11:31,360
Oh! I was fighting these bad guys, you know? Bandits!

177
00:11:31,360 --> 00:11:32,360
Uh-huh! Uh-huh!

178
00:11:32,360 --> 00:11:41,360
And, oh boy! Wow! Talk about a bloodbath! I could've just killed him if I wanted, but I decided to be nice and let him go with a few bones still left intact!

179
00:11:41,360 --> 00:11:47,360
You're not helping, Luck! Then another time I was fighting this really strong mage right now!

180
00:11:47,360 --> 00:11:50,360
Yeah! Thanks, Luck! Now, aren't you getting hungry?

181
00:11:51,360 --> 00:11:57,360
Well, I'd like to hear from Asta! He helped protect the royal capital, didn't you, Asta?

182
00:11:57,360 --> 00:11:59,360
Oh, yeah! That's right!

183
00:11:59,360 --> 00:12:04,360
Wait! Are you talking about the attack the other day? That sounded so scary!

184
00:12:04,360 --> 00:12:08,360
Our Asta wasn't scared, though. He even got a promotion!

185
00:12:08,360 --> 00:12:09,360
Wow!

186
00:12:09,360 --> 00:12:13,360
All right! Got him! Now we just need to keep the conversation on track!

187
00:12:13,360 --> 00:12:15,360
That's amazing!

188
00:12:15,360 --> 00:12:23,360
The people we were fighting were really tough, though! Managed to put three new holes in me, and man, did it hurt!

189
00:12:24,360 --> 00:12:26,360
Wow! It's all squishy, too!

190
00:12:26,360 --> 00:12:29,360
Ow! Geez! Give your hands to yourself!

191
00:12:29,360 --> 00:12:38,360
They're useless! What was I thinking bringing these two? None of my squad mates are mixer material!

192
00:12:38,360 --> 00:12:41,360
Stop it!

193
00:12:41,360 --> 00:12:43,360
Ooh, really?

194
00:12:43,360 --> 00:12:44,360
Well, no.

195
00:12:52,360 --> 00:12:57,360
Maybe I didn't need to keep an eye on things after all. The mixer doesn't look like it's going well.

196
00:12:57,360 --> 00:13:02,360
Not that I care! Darks' social life has nothing to do with me!

197
00:13:02,360 --> 00:13:05,360
Excuse me, miss! Over here!

198
00:13:06,360 --> 00:13:07,360
Huh?

199
00:13:07,360 --> 00:13:08,360
Another round, please!

200
00:13:08,360 --> 00:13:10,360
Go get it yourself! I'm busy!

201
00:13:11,360 --> 00:13:15,360
So you heard about that business and the capital the other day, right?

202
00:13:15,360 --> 00:13:16,360
Hmm.

203
00:13:16,360 --> 00:13:23,360
Well, I was there, guarding a VIP, so I got in on the action, too. Took out a fair number of attackers myself, as a matter of fact.

204
00:13:23,360 --> 00:13:24,360
Hmph!

205
00:13:24,360 --> 00:13:25,360
Ha! Ha!

206
00:13:25,360 --> 00:13:29,360
I didn't expect to get a promotion just for doing my duty, truly!

207
00:13:29,360 --> 00:13:34,360
What's a boy to do, though? I know I didn't deserve the honor, but they insisted, so...

208
00:13:34,360 --> 00:13:35,360
Whoa!

209
00:13:35,360 --> 00:13:39,360
Ha! Ha! Ha! Ha! Oh dear! I may be a tad drunk.

210
00:13:40,360 --> 00:13:41,360
On myself.

211
00:13:42,360 --> 00:13:43,360
Hmm...

212
00:13:44,360 --> 00:13:48,360
And what were you doing during the attack? Reading that dirty book of yours?

213
00:13:48,360 --> 00:13:52,360
What? Shut up! You don't know what you're talking about, sick, eh?

214
00:13:53,360 --> 00:13:56,360
Hey, something wrong? Does being around this make you nervous?

215
00:13:57,360 --> 00:13:58,360
Hmm...

216
00:13:58,360 --> 00:14:01,360
You've got nothing to worry about, ladies! We won't bite, I swear!

217
00:14:01,360 --> 00:14:04,360
He just squeezed that lemon right on the chicken.

218
00:14:04,360 --> 00:14:06,360
Just listening to this guy makes me sick.

219
00:14:06,360 --> 00:14:07,360
Well...

220
00:14:07,360 --> 00:14:09,360
Things look even worse at that table!

221
00:14:09,360 --> 00:14:11,360
Wait, haven't I met that guy before?

222
00:14:11,360 --> 00:14:12,360
Huh.

223
00:14:12,360 --> 00:14:13,360
I think...

224
00:14:13,360 --> 00:14:14,360
Ha-ha!

225
00:14:14,360 --> 00:14:15,360
Right! It's ha-ha!

226
00:14:15,360 --> 00:14:19,360
I knew my bronze magic was good, but I never suspected it was that good!

227
00:14:19,360 --> 00:14:22,360
Honestly, sometimes I scare myself.

228
00:14:22,360 --> 00:14:26,360
Hey, you there! Get me another drink at once!

229
00:14:30,360 --> 00:14:34,360
So that's the magic you used to cut hair? Cool!

230
00:14:34,360 --> 00:14:36,360
Yep, this is it! Here, see?

231
00:14:36,360 --> 00:14:42,360
Wow! It doesn't take much magic power, but your control has to be stellar!

232
00:14:42,360 --> 00:14:43,360
Show me more!

233
00:14:43,360 --> 00:14:46,360
Well, if you want me to...

234
00:14:46,360 --> 00:14:50,360
His eyes are so genuine! How can someone that bloodthirsty be so cute?

235
00:14:50,360 --> 00:14:53,360
And why does it make my stomach all tingly?

236
00:14:53,360 --> 00:14:56,360
Oh no! Do I have a secret love for dangerous men?

237
00:14:57,360 --> 00:15:00,360
Hey, look! Do you think I can see your magic, too?

238
00:15:00,360 --> 00:15:04,360
Yeah, sure! It's kinda tight in here. Let's go out front, kay?

239
00:15:04,360 --> 00:15:05,360
Great!

240
00:15:06,360 --> 00:15:10,360
Nice! Well done, Luck!

241
00:15:10,360 --> 00:15:14,360
Anyway, the sunrise is so beautiful there, you wouldn't believe it!

242
00:15:14,360 --> 00:15:15,360
Wow!

243
00:15:15,360 --> 00:15:20,360
I'll use my spatial magic to take us there sometime. How does that sound?

244
00:15:20,360 --> 00:15:21,360
It sounds good, actually!

245
00:15:21,360 --> 00:15:25,360
Oh, your mug's empty! Excuse me, another round, please!

246
00:15:25,360 --> 00:15:30,360
A little too flashy and not really my type, but he's the best of the three.

247
00:15:30,360 --> 00:15:34,360
He looks like a noble and spatial magic does come in handy. Plus, he's attentive.

248
00:15:34,360 --> 00:15:37,360
Well, shall we go to the veranda?

249
00:15:37,360 --> 00:15:39,360
Sure! That would be nice!

250
00:15:39,360 --> 00:15:40,360
Okay.

251
00:15:42,360 --> 00:15:48,360
Phew! For a while there, things weren't looking good. But now I think this might just be my lucky night.

252
00:15:48,360 --> 00:15:58,360
So awkward! Why is she staring off to the side like that? Is she mad? Is there something on my face?

253
00:15:58,360 --> 00:16:06,360
I can't take it anymore! I don't really know how, but I've got to make this better! I'm not done yet! So, um…

254
00:16:06,360 --> 00:16:11,360
Do you have a favorite food or anything? Me, I like pot potatoes!

255
00:16:12,360 --> 00:16:16,360
You don't have to try so hard to make conversation. It's okay.

256
00:16:17,360 --> 00:16:22,360
Getting all dressed up and coming out was Erika's idea. She thinks I need a man for my siblings' sake.

257
00:16:23,360 --> 00:16:28,360
But I don't even want to be here. I've spent the whole time worrying about my brothers and sisters back home.

258
00:16:29,360 --> 00:16:31,360
Wow! How many siblings do you have?

259
00:16:31,360 --> 00:16:33,360
Three little brothers and two sisters.

260
00:16:33,360 --> 00:16:35,360
Hey! That sounds like me!

261
00:16:35,360 --> 00:16:36,360
Huh?

262
00:16:36,360 --> 00:16:40,360
Well, we're not actually related or anything, but I have five sorta siblings.

263
00:16:40,360 --> 00:16:43,360
They're a bunch of rascals. I miss them now that I'm gone, though.

264
00:16:44,360 --> 00:16:47,360
We had fun, even though we didn't always get along.

265
00:16:49,360 --> 00:16:52,360
Yeah, we slept squished up like sardines.

266
00:16:52,360 --> 00:16:55,360
When I joined the Magic Knights, I got a room all to myself, which was nice.

267
00:16:55,360 --> 00:17:00,360
But, you know, it's kinda lonely not having a pack of restless little kids in there with me.

268
00:17:00,360 --> 00:17:04,360
Oh, yeah! They can be so annoying, but then you miss them when they're not around!

269
00:17:04,360 --> 00:17:09,360
I know! Plus, they help keep me in line sometimes, because I always want them to think the best of me.

270
00:17:09,360 --> 00:17:10,360
It's weird.

271
00:17:10,360 --> 00:17:11,360
I totally understand.

272
00:17:11,360 --> 00:17:15,360
Hey, wait! She's actually laughing now? How could this be happening?

273
00:17:16,360 --> 00:17:23,360
Hey, what kind of serving girl are you? I gave you a chance since you were begging for a job, and then you send customers flying and start breaking my plates?

274
00:17:23,360 --> 00:17:25,360
That's enough out of you!

275
00:17:27,360 --> 00:17:29,360
I'm not surprised you're a big sister. You seem like the type.

276
00:17:30,360 --> 00:17:33,360
I have to admit, you don't really come across as the oldest in your family.

277
00:17:34,360 --> 00:17:36,360
There was actually another kid there my age. His name's Yuno.

278
00:17:36,360 --> 00:17:46,360
Well, well. Having some fun over here, are we? Mr. Fancy Magic Knight.

279
00:17:47,360 --> 00:17:57,360
Whoa, you're a runty thing. And you're in the Magic Knights? Really? Must not be too hard to get in. Maybe I ought to give it a try. I mean, they let you join.

280
00:17:57,360 --> 00:18:01,360
Yeah? Sometimes I still don't even believe it myself.

281
00:18:01,360 --> 00:18:10,360
Hey, now. You got a lot of nerve going after a pretty lady like her. What's she want with you anyway? Got a thing for Magic Knights?

282
00:18:11,360 --> 00:18:16,360
Huh? Huh? You look familiar. I've seen you somewhere.

283
00:18:17,360 --> 00:18:25,360
Ah, working in that restaurant with a kid strapped to your back. You're always sweating your tail off surrounded by a bunch of brats.

284
00:18:25,360 --> 00:18:31,360
Those your kids hanging around, huh? Did your man leave you high and dry?

285
00:18:32,360 --> 00:18:33,360
No, I am not their mother.

286
00:18:34,360 --> 00:18:37,360
No wonder you're trying to land a Magic Knight. That sure would make your life easier.

287
00:18:38,360 --> 00:18:43,360
Well, you're pretty enough. You want a man that bad? Let me help you, sweet cheeks.

288
00:18:44,360 --> 00:18:45,360
Hey, get off! Let me go!

289
00:18:48,360 --> 00:18:52,360
I don't know what you think you're doing, old man, but you better let her go.

290
00:18:52,360 --> 00:18:55,360
You don't know the first thing about that woman!

291
00:18:56,360 --> 00:19:02,360
Ooh, so scary. I'm quaking in my boots, Mr. Magic Knight. What kind of spell you're gonna throw at me?

292
00:19:03,360 --> 00:19:05,360
Actually, I can't use magic.

293
00:19:06,360 --> 00:19:11,360
What? You're a Magic Knight who can't do magic? Is that some kind of joke?

294
00:19:11,360 --> 00:19:14,360
Nope. But check this out!

295
00:19:14,360 --> 00:19:15,360
But check this out!

296
00:19:28,360 --> 00:19:31,360
Forget it. Let's get out of here. What a waste of time.

297
00:19:31,360 --> 00:19:32,360
Wanna go somewhere else?

298
00:19:32,360 --> 00:19:35,360
What did you do to my table?

299
00:19:36,360 --> 00:19:37,360
We gotta go! Quick!

300
00:19:37,360 --> 00:19:38,360
Wait! Come back!

301
00:19:39,360 --> 00:19:41,360
I just remembered, there's somewhere I need to be.

302
00:19:42,360 --> 00:19:43,360
Huh? Hey!

303
00:19:43,360 --> 00:19:58,360
You were really great back there. Thank you so much.

304
00:19:59,360 --> 00:20:02,360
No problem. Sorry I kinda ruined the mixer for you.

305
00:20:02,360 --> 00:20:03,360
You didn't, though.

306
00:20:07,360 --> 00:20:11,360
He's on the short side, but there's something about this kid.

307
00:20:11,360 --> 00:20:12,360
Huh?

308
00:20:14,360 --> 00:20:15,360
Hey, Asta?

309
00:20:16,360 --> 00:20:20,360
Do- do you have anyone who's special to you?

310
00:20:20,360 --> 00:20:22,360
Yes! I've got my heart set on someone!

311
00:20:22,360 --> 00:20:23,360
What?!

312
00:20:23,360 --> 00:20:28,360
Oh, okay. She must be pretty amazing.

313
00:20:29,360 --> 00:20:30,360
She is! She's from my-

314
00:20:30,360 --> 00:20:31,360
I'll be reading for you.

315
00:20:32,360 --> 00:20:33,360
Yeah? Thanks.

316
00:20:34,360 --> 00:20:37,360
Hey, you should come over sometime and meet the kids. I think they'd like you.

317
00:20:38,360 --> 00:20:39,360
You got it!

318
