Is it possible?

322
00:20:47,360 --> 00:20:48,360
Could he be talking about-

323
00:20:49,360 --> 00:20:50,360
No. No way!

324
00:20:50,360 --> 00:20:52,360
And so what if he is?

325
00:20:52,360 --> 00:20:53,360
It's not like it matters.

326
00:20:53,360 --> 00:20:54,360
Not to me.

327
00:20:54,360 --> 00:20:55,360
Not at all.

328
00:20:55,360 --> 00:20:57,360
Not one tiny little bit.

329
00:20:59,360 --> 00:21:01,360
Keep waiting for me, Sister Lily.

330
00:21:02,360 --> 00:21:05,360
One day after I've become the Wizard King, I'll come back for you.

331
00:21:05,360 --> 00:21:07,360
And when I do, please marry me!

332
00:21:08,360 --> 00:21:11,360
I may be rooting for him, but that doesn't mean I'm giving up.

333
00:21:13,360 --> 00:21:16,360
Oh yeah, I never figured it out. What was the point of the whole mixer thing?

334
00:21:16,360 --> 00:21:17,360
What?!

335
00:21:18,360 --> 00:21:19,360
What?!

336
00:21:21,360 --> 00:21:25,360
He threw some drunk guy into a table. Those Black Bull Knights are such savages.

